s são indicativos. Fotos ilustrativas, devendo ser verificados in loco pelo interessado e na documentação do imóvel.\nValores e disponibilidade sujeitos a confirmação e sob consulta.\n\nAgende sua visita e descubra o melhor do alto padrão em Curitiba!","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/677c266c52a91037b3506ee2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5b6a2376-64b3-4d7f-beec-2d62899908ae.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/677c266c52a91037b3506ee2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9857b35e-9273-4f58-a9ae-eba174d17cd2.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/677c266c52a91037b3506ee2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/6fe346f0-6e4e-4d6d-a1af-8c04e0f00a0a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/677c266c52a91037b3506ee2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5f83ad8f-5c76-4279-a551-24acb7d9c4c8.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/677c266c52a91037b3506ee2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/bab35800-d0c0-4b08-917b-840b2d4056ae.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/677c266c52a91037b3506ee2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/e6602f23-4981-41ad-ab4b-c48ee3359505.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/677c266c52a91037b3506ee2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b9b588d2-eac6-48b3-8d9e-5f6e67409cab.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/677c266c52a91037b3506ee2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5c5d89d6-650d-4bc6-a87e-7c45d6410ca6.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/677c266c52a91037b3506ee2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/5c547e54-8c38-4d1d-aef8-4d0968df374f.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/677c266c52a91037b3506ee2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/891e3aa9-3235-4e73-bd51-6247cf6903e4.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/677c266c52a91037b3506ee2/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b22ba30b-618f-4473-bcf3-618ad7a390ad.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/677c266c52a91037b3506ee2/pilar-homes-images-wat